   $q$What is the most reasonable inference about why Ms. Achterberg removes the label but does not write a new one?$q$, $q$[{"text":"She thinks labels distract visitors and wants the sampler shown without one.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"She no longer trusts the old attribution, but the evidence cannot yet support a new one.","is_correct":true},{"text":"She has proved that A.R. made the sampler and is waiting to announce it.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"overstated-inference"},{"text":"She plans to let Mei-Lin write the new label as a reward for her work.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$She no longer trusts the old attribution, but the evidence cannot yet support a new one.$q$, $q$The mismatched initials and uneven border cast doubt on the label, yet she lists several possible explanations, so no replacement claim is ready. She never says she has proved who made it; she calls each idea only "possibly" true.$q$, 'draft', '0eeda0be-76cb-58e3-b418-43df3bd2282e')
